<title>ITALY: Gross yields fall at Italian BTP bond auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yields fall at Italian BTP bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for an 11th tranche of 2.0 trillion lire worth of three-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (BTPs) with a 6.00 percent coupon, and a ninth tranche of 2.0 trillion lire of 6.25 percent five-year BTPs.</p>
<p>		  May 15, 2000   pvs	 May 15, 2002   pvs</p>
<p> Net Yield	  5.00 pct    5.14	  5.04 pct    5.20</p>
<p> Gross Yield	5.78 pct    5.92	  5.88 pct    6.04</p>
<p> Assigned price 100.75	100.40	101.85	101.20</p>
<p> Bids	     4.125 trln lire	   3.720 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	 2.000 trln lire	   2.000 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Results compare with a previous auction on July 15.</p>
</text>
